Conclusion: R015's "audit skills-lock.json" is satisfied with no file edit. skills-lock.json is owned by the npx skills CLI and lives outside this repo; it is only relevant to third-party skills installs, never to BotTech's own skills. The mitigation for any prior install referencing the old gsd-new-cli-project path is the v0.2 migration note added to README.md in T01. Submodule wiring remains clean: agent-first-cli/assets/samples/gitignorer resolves at heads/main.
